---
description: "Security and settings for FastAPI."
globs:
  - "app/core/**/*.py"
  - "app/api/**/*.py"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md`.

Security checklist:

- Load secrets from environment via Pydantic Settings; never hardcode.
- Do not commit `.env` or production credentials.
- Validate all external payloads with Pydantic v2.
- Prefer explicit auth dependencies over ad hoc checks in handlers.
